## LEAD CLUSTER 1 — CORS reflect-any-origin + credentials on `/v1/**`
*Source: all 5 models, 40+ reconfirmations*

| Q | Answer |
|---|---|
| Q1 In scope? | **YES** — `api.sparelabs.com` |
| Q2 Attacker-reachable? | **YES** — public, unauthenticated |
| Q3 Real impact? | **YES** — but capped: API is Bearer-only (no Set-Cookie), so cross-origin credentialed read requires victim client auto-attaching a token. Still a real A05:2021 misconfig. |
| Q4 Passive proof? | **YES** — OPTIONS preflight + GET with `Origin: https://evil.example.com` confirms ACAO reflection + ACAC:true + all methods + Authorization header |
| Q5 Novel? | **NO** — already VALID as A1 since 2026-08-07 22:00 UTC |
| Q6 Always-rejected? | **NO** — real misconfig, not best-practice-only |
| Q7 Triager accept? | **YES** — accepted 20+ times |

**Verdict: Already VALID (A1).** Reconfirmed stable. CVSS 8.1 High. Reporting channel: Spare security (TBD).

